rted to enjoyed it.\nTheirs belly started to become so nig and tight and finely popped together.\nThey're still fine after all.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CzGrLYXfo8PUJsgJbE3AYGqpgGRYKfUm", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Norsu327/works/79", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3dd7970/uploads/origins/1d8e33c7-8d5e-4550-aacb-e86ec5715822?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fe083792df55c79bf78ff57d4a314f3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3dd7970/uploads/origins/1d8e33c7-8d5e-4550-aacb-e86ec5715822?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fe083792df55c79bf78ff57d4a314f3, https://si.imgix.net/d3dd7970/uploads/origins/1d8e33c7-8d5e-4550-aacb-e86ec5715822?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a45127cf5eb5264aab9611eabe54f0f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3dd7970/uploads/origins/1d8e33c7-8d5e-4550-aacb-e86ec5715822?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08f7fe10351c9a416d4d62c705e1f1fe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！ビーチで水着を着ているお腹の大きなオオカミの写真が欲しいです。蕎麦茶を飲んでいる！右目に傷があり、黒い強膜は着衣の写真に写っています。\n\nhttps://x.com/BigBellyTanuki/status/1947792437901979664 https://x.com/JerichOgami/status/1944021859495792932 https://x.com/Norsu327/status/1662823786050387968 https://x.com/Norsu327/status/1868304324729966956", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Norsu327/works/78", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc69712c/uploads/origins/09d31d09-4cbc-47e3-a582-b6a8d85f9b3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf4e9829ec9dd40ea4004d6e741c1e3e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bc69712c/uploads/origins/09d31d09-4cbc-47e3-a582-b6a8d85f9b3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf4e9829ec9dd40ea4004d6e741c1e3e, https://si.imgix.net/bc69712c/uploads/origins/09d31d09-4cbc-47e3-a582-b6a8d85f9b3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f80bfac511166a06ba4b00a87d10c8e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bc69712c/uploads/origins/09d31d09-4cbc-47e3-a582-b6a8d85f9b3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0f0a1c9d5859f7ad79cca4c0ccc8614 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私の植物犬のキャラクターが背もたれにもたれかかって座り、口を大きく開けて、分厚いスライムで満たされています。\n\n私のキャラクターリファレンスはこちら：https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/jrhh17f1wo8s3jufofzkf/Tayngo-ref.png?rlkey=quy5j4r7cbfcy05rbld7iwkqm&st=91pz2y2j&dl=0\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/jrhh17f1wo8s3jufofzkf/Tayngo-ref.png?rlkey=quy5j4r7cbfcy05rbld7iwkqm&st=91pz2y2j&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Norsu327/works/77", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/06ec5d00/uploads/origins/97b3691e-e26e-4ac6-a265-f73d4cab0def?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd8c7860514112de255a4a2a8ae507a7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/06ec5d00/uploads/origins/97b3691e-e26e-4ac6-a265-f73d4cab0def?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd8c7860514112de255a4a2a8ae507a7, https://si.imgix.net/06ec5d00/uploads/origins/97b3691e-e26e-4ac6-a265-f73d4cab0def?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d98cf980d74462b6703aa57a1af2101a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/06ec5d00/uploads/origins/97b3691e-e26e-4ac6-a265-f73d4cab0def?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34f38afad2f6f3fad33bb8153e28af6b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエスト失礼します。\n今回はヤコンさんの絵をお願いします。\n前回パンパンに膨らんだのが癖になってしまったヤコンさんは特性エネルギーホースをおしりに入れてパンパンになったお腹と大きくなった胸を触りながら膨らんで行っている様子をお願いします。\n表情は舌を出しながらとっても気持ちよさそうにしている感じでお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Norsu327/works/76", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bec4e2e3/uploads/origins/42e2da15-139a-41ce-b481-f9838530fe30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14d8b67cca63965dd438f2f044521ea6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bec4e2e3/uploads/origins/42e2da15-139a-41ce-b481-f9838530fe30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14d8b67cca63965dd438f2f044521ea6, https://si.imgix.net/bec4e2e3/uploads/origins/42e2da15-139a-41ce-b481-f9838530fe30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c44180af3b9e48e2af9001c8e64d7fa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bec4e2e3/uploads/origins/42e2da15-139a-41ce-b481-f9838530fe30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2b00ac55fd69cf64eb14bd644b31528 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエスト失礼します。\n今回もまた二星龍さんの絵をお願いします!\nシチュエーションは前回のその後で肥育液を消化したあとの二星龍さんの姿をお願いします。\n体型は胸が膨らんでお腹ももっちり脂肪が付いていて下腹の土手肉がパンパンに詰まってる感じでお願いします。\n表情は頬を赤くして少し恥ずかしがっている感じで、ポーズは自分の胸やお腹をもちもち触っているのでお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Norsu327/works/75", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8acea97f/uploads/origins/8f4ed7c9-e71a-4a2d-9fce-fcc558124f7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8425a78957c164e0bfc74574530ae00d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8acea97f/uploads/origins/8f4ed7c9-e71a-4a2d-9fce-fcc558124f7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8425a78957c164e0bfc74574530ae00d, https://si.imgix.net/8acea97f/uploads/origins/8f4ed7c9-e71a-4a2d-9fce-fcc558124f7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d111e3d23d3bd94aa2dbe0a727b24ce0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8acea97f/uploads/origins/8f4ed7c9-e71a-4a2d-9fce-fcc558124f7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b809b14ff96c702dc59bdbab36d6e54 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "星のカービィシリーズに登場する、ドロッチェ団の「ストロン」が過食によって激太りしているイラストをお腹します。でべそと大きく膨れたお腹が目立つ構図だと嬉しいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Norsu327/works/74", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7b09907/uploads/origins/644ce1a3-10ba-415c-8c16-7bb2625e1f56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22a3fdae09363aba7a53aec689960cf2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e7b09907/uploads/origins/644ce1a3-10ba-415c-8c16-7bb2625e1f56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22a3fdae09363aba7a53aec689960cf2, https://si.imgix.net/e7b09907/uploads/origins/644ce1a3-10ba-415c-8c16-7bb2625e1f56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4870a36d9d255f35690375b6978fed7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e7b09907/uploads/origins/644ce1a3-10ba-415c-8c16-7bb2625e1f56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa831e8043546cc9bb00a50d5ed02452 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエスト失礼します。\n今回はまた二星龍さんの絵をリクエストさせていただきます。\nシチュエーションは前回五星龍にギッチギチの寸前までスライムを詰め込まれたのが癖になってしまって、自分で肥育ホースを使ってさらに大きなお腹になろうとしている二星龍さんをお願いします。お腹は前回よりさらに大きくなっておへそが出てきてデベソになってる感じでお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Norsu327/works/73", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3638cf22/uploads/origins/be19ba67-85d7-424f-9e5d-917ebd8554ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4c635ebf5b59c8f75775c1624e68fb8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3638cf22/uploads/origins/be19ba67-85d7-424f-9e5d-917ebd8554ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4c635ebf5b59c8f75775c1624e68fb8, https://si.imgix.net/3638cf22/uploads/origins/be19ba67-85d7-424f-9e5d-917ebd8554ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f13c6dfc1ff20527a7613c0582440848 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3638cf22/uploads/origins/be19ba67-85d7-424f-9e5d-917ebd8554ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14a7bbf6936669d056136f81d2e6853e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエスト失礼します  \n今回もドラゴンボールよりヤコンさんが特大の光のエナジーボールを飲み込んでしまって全身が一気にパンク寸前まで膨らんでしまっているヤコンさんをお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Norsu327/works/72", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/94094546/uploads/origins/5e9434f6-f37f-43a5-a83f-dde5e190b8b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6c116fa1a9352c2e6ef4e7e85ed592e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/94094546/uploads/origins/5e9434f6-f37f-43a5-a83f-dde5e190b8b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6c116fa1a9352c2e6ef4e7e85ed592e, https://si.imgix.net/94094546/uploads/origins/5e9434f6-f37f-43a5-a83f-dde5e190b8b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9b5d4f156b82a8c933f32cc79915160 2x, https://si.imgix.net/94094546/uploads/origins/5e9434f6-f37f-43a5-a83f-dde5e190b8b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9174c820fb6137ad62f0422524140ab0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Once again I am very interested in another commission depicting my large bomb cat and his girlfriend as both of their designs have been updated recently! \n\nIt would be very cute to see the two interacting with one another, Launch having grown far fatter than normal and the white cat embracing his large belly and hugging his fat soft frame, she would be very interested in how heavy he has become teasing him for the weight gained, but loving it all the same! \n\nLaunch’s expression would be very embarrassed at how far he has become! \n\nThe references included will show their new designs as well as their updated height in comparison with one another. Thank you very much for your consideration!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/bkc2w7he46y971wayo7rr/AN74zyF2UfNX8TPL4YG_UFo?rlkey=dr54c52swh5mqmkazfaveto26&st=o1j6jntj&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Norsu327/works/71", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/64377f6f/uploads/origins/b6686f34-2d8a-41f8-a054-bed454f0f6e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress